OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FDry with
OL,6,Fsome late brightness this evening.
OL,7,FThen the rest of the night will be
OL,8,Fmainly dry with just the light shower.
OL,9,FFresh to strong north to northwesterly
OL,10,Fwinds.
OL,11,
OL,12,CWednesday:FIt will be a dry day with
OL,13,Fsome bright or sunny spells.
OL,14,FNorthwesterly winds soon easing.
OL,15,
OL,16,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:FDry
OL,17,Ffor most of Thursday but rain during
OL,18,Fthe evening. Bright spells and the odd
OL,19,Fshower on Friday. Rain likely on
OL,20,FSaturday.
